# The Earth King: "search your library for up to that many basic land cards ... then shuffle" (CR 701.23, 701.24): with only a non-basic land
# left in the library the search finds nothing, the player cannot choose it, and the library is shuffled all the same.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
The Earth King
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Tropical Island
Tropical Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Earth King.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Attack(Bear Token > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Search(Tropical Island)
Bot1.Search()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Shuffles = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Library.Count = 12
